    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e2ca5b2c-eda9-40e9-904a-61937193d6bc\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><p class=\"title\">Technical Document</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\">This document details out what all components and applications are deployed in Bahmni Production Server at a high level. For failover / disaster recovery, some deployments may use a Primary/Secondary or a Master/Slave deployment architecture.</div></div><p> </p><h1 id=\"BahmniServerDeploymentArchitecture-HighLevelDiagram\">High Level Diagram </h1><p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-warning conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"ce5218cf-94b7-45b3-8701-ef93f4c8d466\" data-macro-name=\"warning\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-error confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><h3 id=\"BahmniServerDeploymentArchitecture-Oops,DiagramUnavailable\">Oops, Diagram Unavailable</h3><p>This diagram can't be displayed. It may have been moved or deleted, or the page's access settings may be preventing it from loading. Pages with restricted access must also include Gliffy Diagrams in their allowed list.</p></div></div></p><h1 id=\"BahmniServerDeploymentArchitecture-ApplicationInstallationLocations\">Application Installation Locations</h1><p>The following are the RPMs that are installed on the Bahmni machine<span style=\"font-size: medium;\" class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span style=\"line-height: 24.0px;\">:</span></span></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"wrapped confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTh\"> </th><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Packag